  "title": "The National Security Unit for Procurement",
  "canonical_url": "https://www.gov.uk/guidance/the-national-security-unit-for-procurement",
  "description": "An overview of the National Security Unit for Procurement (NSUP), who are responsible for the national security provisions set out in the Procurement Act 2023",
  "publication_date": "2025-03-13T00:00:00+00:00",
